Package: argentinaDengueAnalysis
Title: Argentina Dengue Surveillance Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Andrés",
        "Lemos",
        email = "andlefa@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Reproducible R workflow for acquiring, validating,
    canonically selecting, structurally harmonizing, and
    descriptively visualizing official dengue surveillance data
    published by the Argentine Ministry of Health. The project
    emphasizes contract-first design, transparent provenance,
    and explicit analytical scope.
